@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
# Írd át egy létező párra (lista: GET /travels)
@flight = 1
@user = 1

### Lista (innen nézd ki a flight_id / user_id párokat)
GET {{base}}/travels
Accept: application/json

### Show
GET {{base}}/travels/{{flight}}/{{user}}
Accept: application/json

### Destroy
DELETE {{base}}/travels/{{flight}}/{{user}}
Accept: application/json

### Show törlés után (404-et vársz)
GET {{base}}/travels/{{flight}}/{{user}}
Accept: application/json

### Store (visszarakja a törölt rekordot)
POST {{base}}/travels
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "evaluation": "foglalva",
  "flight_id": {{flight}},
  "user_id": {{user}}
}
